        "下一課會看到：這一點有兩條不同的切線"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "t_1^2=t_2^2\\ \\Rightarrow\\ t_2=-t_1",
        "t^3-3t=-t^3+3t\\ \\Rightarrow\\ 2t(t^2-3)=0",
        "x=3,\\quad y=3\\sqrt3-3\\sqrt3=0"
      ]
